{"id":"657999","name":"牛肉拌黄瓜","author":"蓝雨阳光780913","authorId":"11379263","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/657999/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"200g"},{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"200g"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菜叶","amount":"20g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"黄瓜去掉皮切成片。","img":"images/657999/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"牛肉切成片放入盐腌制一会儿。","img":"images/657999/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"小米辣和葱切碎。","img":"images/657999/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"牛肉放入开水中烫一下变色。","img":"images/657999/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"捞出沥水。","img":"images/657999/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把香菜叶放入，加入盐，小米辣碎，葱碎拌匀。","img":"images/657999/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"抓拌均匀。","img":"images/657999/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"装盘即可。","img":"images/657999/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}